{"date": "2021-04-12", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0412.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:46:47+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "b19334de96b4559f9bbfec43c7c0643818e010b57333f7165cbd49d9ed920466", "image_bytes": 120775, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Sat, 10 Apr 2021 03:20:44 GMT", "title": "宜注目", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "记忆与印象", "author": "史铁生", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "生和死都取决于观察，取决于观察的远与近。比如，当一颗距离我们十万光年的星星实际早已熄灭，它却正在我们的视野里度着它的青年时光。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
